; Relay (issue #377, a King of the Hill stage with a moving hill): three
; platforms, centre, left and right, and the hill hops between them every
; ~30 s (HillSpot0 first, then 1, 2, and round again) with a warning ring on the
; next spot for the last ~3 s. Pads on the floor reach each platform.
; Rotation (Stage.mode_weights): weighted 4x for King of the Hill, and in any
; other mode dealt into a bag only 30% of the time ("_other").

